### Register User API
POST http://localhost:8001/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "username" : "ervan",
    "password" : "rahasia",
    "name" : "Fernanda Ervan"
}

### Login User API
POST http://localhost:8001/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "username" : "ervan",
    "password" : "rahasia"
}

### Get Current User API
GET http://localhost:8001/api/users/current
Accept: application/json
Authorization: a6790dca-479e-48b6-b5c4-297723538293

### Update Current User API
PATCH http://localhost:8001/api/users/current
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: a6790dca-479e-48b6-b5c4-297723538293

{
    "name" : "Fernanda Ervans"
}

### Logout User API
DELETE http://localhost:8001/api/users/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: a6790dca-479e-48b6-b5c4-297723538293


